{"body": [{"y0": 66.9, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 414.3, "text": "éta pauper quendam amicum divitem, nómine Fabul- 145"}, {"y0": 85.2, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 248.5, "text": "lum, ad cénam vocàvit:"}, {"y0": 103.1, "x0": 150.8, "x1": 309.0, "text": "Cenáàbis bene, mi Fabulle, apud mé"}, {"y0": 121.6, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 287.2, "text": "paucis, si tibi di favent, diebus"}, {"y0": 140.0, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 339.8, "text": "— si técum attuleris bonam atque magnam"}, {"y0": 158.0, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 414.8, "text": "cénam, nón sine candidà puellà 150"}, {"y0": 176.3, "x0": 151.1, "x1": 307.7, "text": "et vinà et sale et omnibus cachinnis."}, {"y0": 194.5, "x0": 150.6, "x1": 335.8, "text": "Haec si, inquam, attuleris, venuste noster,"}, {"y0": 212.5, "x0": 151.1, "x1": 292.2, "text": "cénábis bene — nam tui Catulli"}, {"y0": 230.9, "x0": 149.9, "x1": 291.7, "text": "plénus sacculus est aráneàrum!?"}, {"y0": 249.0, "x0": 151.1, "x1": 413.6, "text": "Hi versüs magnum risum movent. Tum véró Corne- 1"}, {"y0": 267.2, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 394.5, "text": "lius «Bene quidem\" inquit *et iocose scripsit Catullus,"}, {"y0": 285.8, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 395.0, "text": "nec tamen versüs eius comparandi sunt cum epigram-"}, {"y0": 303.9, "x0": 140.0, "x1": 394.3, "text": "matis sale plénis quae Mártiàlis in inimicos scripsit."}, {"y0": 321.9, "x0": 140.3, "x1": 353.3, "text": "Semper libros Martialis mécum in sinü fero.\""}, {"y0": 339.9, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 414.8, "text": "Ab omnibus rogàtus ut epigrammata recitet, Corné- 160"}, {"y0": 358.3, "x0": 140.1, "x1": 394.8, "text": "lius libellum évolvit et *Incipiam\" inquit \"à versibus"}, {"y0": 376.8, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 299.4, "text": "quós poeta de suis libellis scripsit:"}, {"y0": 395.0, "x0": 150.6, "x1": 367.3, "text": "Laudat, amat, cantat nostros mea Roma libellos,"}, {"y0": 413.0, "x0": 161.7, "x1": 353.3, "text": "méque sinüs omnes, mé manus omnis habet."}, {"y0": 431.4, "x0": 150.4, "x1": 414.3, "text": "Ecce rubet quidam, pallet, stupet, oscitat, odit. 165"}, {"y0": 449.7, "x0": 161.6, "x1": 366.8, "text": "Hoc voló: nunc nobis carmina nostra placent.\""}, {"y0": 468.3, "x0": 151.1, "x1": 395.0, "text": "Post hoc principium Cornelius aliquot epigrammata"}, {"y0": 486.3, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 395.0, "text": "Martiàlis recitat, in iis haec quae scripta sunt in alios"}, {"y0": 505.4, "x0": 139.8, "x1": 171.5, "text": "poétàs:"}, {"y0": 522.5, "x0": 150.9, "x1": 414.8, "text": "Cür nón mittó meos tibi, Ponüliane, libellos? 170"}, {"y0": 541.2, "x0": 161.4, "x1": 336.9, "text": "Né mihi tà mittàás, Pontiliane, tuos! —"}], "margin": [{"y0": 68.7, "x0": 37.6, "x1": 140.2, "text": "[Catullus 13.1—8] |"}, {"y0": 88.1, "x0": 68.2, "x1": 140.2, "text": "v |"}, {"y0": 89.9, "x0": 60.1, "x1": 125.6, "text": "MESES"}, {"y0": 104.7, "x0": 57.2, "x1": 125.0, "text": "| Mises \"uf"}, {"y0": 118.4, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 119.8, "text": "aranea SA"}, {"y0": 151.5, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 90.1, "text": "nón sine : cum"}, {"y0": 160.3, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 99.7, "text": "candida : pulchrà"}, {"y0": 169.5, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 111.9, "text": "sàl : sermó iocósus et"}, {"y0": 178.5, "x0": 42.8, "x1": 71.4, "text": "urbánus"}, {"y0": 187.5, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 116.6, "text": "cachinnus -i n — risus"}, {"y0": 196.5, "x0": 38.3, "x1": 118.6, "text": "inquam (pers 1) 7 dicó"}, {"y0": 206.9, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 127.6, "text": "venuste noster : mi amice"}, {"y0": 250.7, "x0": 37.7, "x1": 126.3, "text": "(risum) movere : excitàre"}, {"y0": 278.0, "x0": 38.1, "x1": 100.9, "text": "epigramma -atis n"}, {"y0": 287.4, "x0": 42.4, "x1": 82.9, "text": "(pl abl -atis)"}, {"y0": 296.4, "x0": 38.5, "x1": 112.3, "text": "Mártiülis -is m: poeta"}, {"y0": 305.4, "x0": 42.8, "x1": 124.3, "text": "Rómànus qui XII libros"}, {"y0": 314.6, "x0": 42.8, "x1": 124.3, "text": "epigrammatum scripsit"}, {"y0": 333.1, "x0": 75.9, "x1": 91.7, "text": "\"ÁS"}, {"y0": 370.2, "x0": 68.3, "x1": 140.2, "text": "Ee Y // sinus |"}, {"y0": 384.4, "x0": 38.8, "x1": 116.9, "text": "[VI.61] \"s